{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 26, :comments ["<b>All the persons being sixty and six.</b> For the children of Leah were 33, and Dinah and Hetzron and Chamul and Yocheved who was born between the walls are included. And the children of Zilpah were sixteen, and Hever and Malkiel are included. And the children of Rachel were 14. And the children of Bilhah were seven. And you need to subtract from them Joseph and his two sons and Yocheved, who did not go out from the land of Canaan, as Rashi explained: 'all the persons coming' — who went out from the land of Canaan to come to Egypt. And 'the issue of his loins' comes to exclude the wives of Jacob, and 'besides the wives of his sons' comes to exclude the twins who were not included in the count. Thus you have sixty and six."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 46, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:08:49.917790539Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}